  "description": "PLCcomModbus is a .NET SDK for building Modbus master and slave applications. It provides a managed API for common Modbus communication scenarios, so you can integrate Modbus devices into your own software without implementing protocol framing, conversion rules, connection handling or Secure Modbus TCP transport details yourself. Usable from C# and Visual Basic. Try it right away: with blank licence fields the library runs with full functionality for 15 minutes during a debugging session. For uninterrupted work, generate a free trial licence (14 days) at https://www.indi-an.com/en/plccom/modbus/modbus-download/",
